/E (The faculty along with III B.Tech. ECE students visited Indian National Centre for Ocean Information Services \(INCOIS\) on 27-11-2024 & 20-12-2024. INCOIS \(Indian National Centre for Ocean Information Services\) is an autonomous organization under the Ministry of Earth Sciences, Government of India, located in Ocean Valley, Pragati Nagar, Hyderabad. It aims to provide oceanographic services, including ocean data, forecasting, and advisories, for the sustainable management of marine resources and disaster risk reduction.)
